<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Obtain stored games -->
  <LetterLabelHuntingSurplus_GainRewardDirectly>獲得貯藏獵物</LetterLabelHuntingSurplus_GainRewardDirectly>
  <!-- EN: Our caravan followed the marks left by kiiros and found the buried games successfully. -->
  <LetterHuntingSurplus_GainRewardDirectly>我們的遠行隊順利地循著綺羅族留下的記號找到了埋藏的獵物。</LetterHuntingSurplus_GainRewardDirectly>

  <!-- EN: The lead hunter, {PAWN_labelShort}, gained {1} animals experience. -->
  <HuntingSurplusHunterXPGain>領隊的獵人，{PAWN_labelShort}，獲得了{1}馴獸經驗值。</HuntingSurplusHunterXPGain>
  <!-- EN: Encoutner with manhunter -->
  <LetterLabelHuntingSurplus_Raid>遭遇獵殺人類</LetterLabelHuntingSurplus_Raid>
  <!-- EN: A group of predators has taken over stored games of kiiros! Upon seeing us approach, they have shown a desire to attack. -->
  <LetterHuntingSurplus_Raid>一群捕食者將綺羅們貯藏的獵物佔爲己有了！看見我們靠近后，它們表現出了攻擊的慾望。</LetterHuntingSurplus_Raid>
  <!-- EN: Returned empty-handed -->
  <LetterLabelHuntingSurplus_GainNothing>空手而歸</LetterLabelHuntingSurplus_GainNothing>
  <!-- EN: Although we found the marks left by kiiros on the ground, the stored game has disappeared without a trace, leaving some drag marks on the ground. Perhaps someone discovered it before us, or hungry animals have already devoured all the game. Either way, this time we can only return empty-handed. -->
  <LetterHuntingSurplus_GainNothing>雖然找到了綺羅族在地上留下的記號，但貯藏的獵物卻不見了蹤影，地上只留下了一些拖拽的痕跡。或許有人先我們一步發現，又或者是飢餓的動物已經把這些獵物吃干抹凈，無論如何，我們這次只能空手而歸了。</LetterHuntingSurplus_GainNothing>


  <!-- EN: Sky lantern festival successfully completed -->
  <LetterLabelSkyLanternFestival_FinishDirectly>天燈節圓滿完成</LetterLabelSkyLanternFestival_FinishDirectly>
  <!-- EN: We enjoyed a delightful sky lantern festival with {0}'s kiiro, and our relationship has increased by {1}. -->
  <LetterSkyLanternFestival_FinishDirectly>我們與{0}的綺羅們度過了一次愉快的天燈節，彼此的關係增加了{1}。</LetterSkyLanternFestival_FinishDirectly>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}, a lost {PAWN_title}, was guided by the sky lanterns and found the location of us. {PAWN_pronoun} requests to join our caravan.\n\n{PAWN_pronoun} claims to have nowhere else to go and is willing to contribute. {PAWN_subjective} will not leave voluntarily, and you can choose to refuse {PAWN_objective}. If you refuse {PAWN_objective}'s joining, the accompanying kiiros are willing to temporarily shelter {PAWN_nameDef} until {PAWN_objective} is willing to embark on the journey again. -->
  <LetterSkyLanternFestival_WandererJoin>{PAWN_nameDef}，一名迷路的{PAWN_title}受到天燈的指引，找到了天燈節的所在地。[PAWN_pronoun]請求加入我們的遠行隊。\n\n[PAWN_pronoun]聲稱沒有地方可去，並且願意做出貢獻。{PAWN_objective}不會主動離開，你可以選擇拒絕{PAWN_objective}。如果拒絕{PAWN_objective}加入的話，同行的綺羅願意暫時收留{PAWN_nameDef}直到{PAWN_objective}願意重新踏上旅程。</LetterSkyLanternFestival_WandererJoin>
  <!-- EN: Accepted with pleasure -->
  <Kiiro_SkyLanternWandererAccept>欣然接受</Kiiro_SkyLanternWandererAccept>
  <!-- EN: Gently refuse -->
  <Kiiro_SkyLanternWandererReject>委婉拒絕</Kiiro_SkyLanternWandererReject>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} joined -->
  <LetterLabelSkyLanternFestival_AcceptWandererJoin>{PAWN_nameDef}加入</LetterLabelSkyLanternFestival_AcceptWandererJoin>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has joined our caravan. -->
  <LetterSkyLanternFestival_AcceptWandererJoin>{PAWN_nameDef}加入了我們的遠行隊。</LetterSkyLanternFestival_AcceptWandererJoin>
  <!-- EN: Refused {PAWN_nameDef} -->
  <LetterLabelSkyLanternFestival_RejectWandererJoin>拒絕{PAWN_nameDef}加入</LetterLabelSkyLanternFestival_RejectWandererJoin>
  <!-- EN: We politely refused {PAWN_nameDef}'s request to join. The accompanying kiiro have temporarily taken in {PAWN_nameDef} until {PAWN_nameDef} finds a way back home. -->
  <LetterSkyLanternFestival_RejectWandererJoin>我們委婉地拒絕了{PAWN_nameDef}的加入請求。同行的綺羅暫時收留了{PAWN_nameDef}，直到{PAWN_nameDef}找到回家的方法。</LetterSkyLanternFestival_RejectWandererJoin>
  
  
  <!-- EN: Bonfire party successfully completed -->
  <LetterLabelBonfireParty_FinishDirectly>篝火晚會圓滿結束</LetterLabelBonfireParty_FinishDirectly>
  <!-- EN: The bonfire party ended amid laughter and cheer, and the members of our caravan found relaxation both in body and mind. Our relationship with {0} has increased by {1}. -->
  <LetterBonfireParty_FinishDirectly>篝火晚會在一片歡聲笑語中結束了，遠行隊的成員都得到了身心上的放鬆。我們與{0}的關係增加了{1}。</LetterBonfireParty_FinishDirectly>
  <!-- EN: The bonfire party ended amid laughter and cheer, and the members of our caravan found relaxation both in body and mind. Our relationship with {0} has increased by {1}.\n\nThere was some leftover food from the party, and our caravan took some with them. -->
  <LetterBonfireParty_FinishAndGainFood>篝火晚會在一片歡聲笑語中結束了，遠行隊的成員都得到了身心上的放鬆。我們與{0}的關係增加了{1}。\n\n晚會剩下了一些食物，我們的遠行隊帶走了一些。</LetterBonfireParty_FinishAndGainFood>
  
  <!-- EN: Food giving -->
  <LetterLabelBonfireParty_FoodGiving>食物贈予</LetterLabelBonfireParty_FoodGiving>
  <!-- EN: Hearing about our food shortage, kiiros generously donated several days' worth of rations to our caravan. -->
  <LetterBonfireParty_FoodGiving>聽說了我們缺少食物的訊息，綺羅贈送了幾天的口糧給我們的遠行隊。</LetterBonfireParty_FoodGiving>
  
  
  
  <!-- 紙藝展會壞結果 -->
  <!-- EN: Paper art exhibition: attacked -->
  <LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_Raid>紙藝展會：遇襲</LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_Raid>
  <!-- EN: A group of {0} has surrounded the exhibition! This appears to be a premeditated ambush.\n\nThe kiiro's exhibition security team will cover the retreat of civilians and paper artists and join us in the battle. -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_Raid>一夥{0}包圍了展會！這看起來像是一次充滿預謀的伏擊。\n\n綺羅族的展會護衛小隊會掩護平民和紙藝師撤退並和我們一起戰鬥。</LetterPaperArtExhibition_Raid>
  <!-- EN: disastrous paper art exhibition -->
  <LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_Bad>糟糕的紙藝展會</LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_Bad>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}, representing caravan, made a speech that revealed {PAWN_pronoun} didn't have much knowledge in the field of art, causing an awkward atmosphere at the exhibition. After a brief exchange of opinions, the paper art exhibition concluded hastily. {0}'s paper artists were somewhat disappointed that we didn't give much importance to the exhibition, and our relationship with {0} has decreased by {1}. -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_Bad>代表遠行隊出席的{PAWN_nameDef}發表的言論暴露出[PAWN_pronoun]在藝術方面並沒有太多的瞭解，這使得展會一度陷入了尷尬的氛圍。簡單地交換過意見后，這次紙藝展會便草草收場了。{0}的紙藝師們有些遺憾地認為我們沒有重視這次展會，與{0}的關係下降了{1}。</LetterPaperArtExhibition_Bad>
  <!-- 紙藝展會好結果 -->
  <!-- EN: Paper art exhibition successfully completed -->
  <LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_Finish>紙藝展會落幕</LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_Finish>
  <!-- EN: {0}'s paper art exhibition concluded successfully, and the participating artists exchanged inspiration and opinions regarding origami artworks.\n\nThe caravan members who participated in the paper art exchange gained 4000 points of art experience and 2000 points of crafting experience. -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_Finish>{0}舉辦的紙藝展會順利地落幕了，參會的藝術家們針對摺紙藝術品充分交換了靈感和意見。\n\n參與紙藝交流的遠行隊成員們獲得了4000點藝術經驗和2000點手工經驗。</LetterPaperArtExhibition_Finish>
  <!-- EN: {0}'s paper art exhibition concluded successfully, and the participating artists exchanged inspiration and opinions regarding origami artworks.\n\nThe caravan members who participated in the paper art exchange gained 4000 points of art experience and 2000 points of crafting experience.\n\nOne of the paper artists at the venue had a delightful conversation with {PAWN_nameDef}, and to commemorate their meeting, she gifted one of her prized works to {PAWN_nameDef} upon parting.\n\n"May we have the chance to meet again!" -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_FinishWithPaperArt>{0}舉辦的紙藝展會順利地落幕了，參會的各方藝術家針對摺紙藝術品充分交換了靈感和意見。\n\n參與紙藝交流的遠行隊成員們獲得了4000點藝術經驗和2000點手工經驗。\n\n會場的一位紙藝師與{PAWN_nameDef}相談甚歡，爲了紀念這次相遇，臨別時她將自己的一個得意作品贈送給了{PAWN_nameDef}。\n\n「愿我們還有機會相見！」</LetterPaperArtExhibition_FinishWithPaperArt>
  <!-- 紙藝師請求加入 -->
  <!-- EN: Accepted with pleasure -->
  <Kiiro_PaperArtExhibitionArtistAccept>欣然同意</Kiiro_PaperArtExhibitionArtistAccept>
  <!-- EN: Gently refuse -->
  <Kiiro_PaperArtExhibitionArtistReject>委婉拒絕</Kiiro_PaperArtExhibitionArtistReject>
  <!-- EN: After witnessing {PAWN1_nameDef}'s unique insights into art, paper artist {PAWN2_nameDef} was deeply impressed. {PAWN_pronoun} requested to follow {PAWN1_nameDef} to deepen {PAWN_pronoun}'s own skills in paper art. -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_ArtistJoin>見識過{PAWN1_nameDef}對藝術的獨到見解后，紙藝師{PAWN2_nameDef}深感受用。[PAWN_pronoun]請求跟隨{PAWN1_nameDef}學習，以加深自己的紙藝造詣。</LetterPaperArtExhibition_ArtistJoin>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN2_nameDef} joined -->
  <LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_AcceptArtistJoin>{PAWN2_nameDef}加入</LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_AcceptArtistJoin>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN2_nameDef} joined {PAWN1_nameDef}'s caravan. -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_AcceptArtistJoin>{PAWN2_nameDef}加入了{PAWN1_nameDef}的遠行隊。</LetterPaperArtExhibition_AcceptArtistJoin>
  <!-- EN: Refuse {PAWN2_nameDef} politely -->
  <LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_RejectArtistJoin>婉拒{PAWN2_nameDef}加入</LetterLabelPaperArtExhibition_RejectArtistJoin>
  <!-- EN: We politely declined {PAWN2_nameDef}'s request to join. While there was some regret, {PAWN2_nameDef} expressed {PAWN_pronoun}'s determination to continue learning and looked forward to meeting again in the future. -->
  <LetterPaperArtExhibition_RejectArtistJoin>我們婉拒了{PAWN2_nameDef}的加入請求。雖然有些遺憾，但{PAWN2_nameDef}表示自己還是會努力地學習，期待著將來再次相遇。</LetterPaperArtExhibition_RejectArtistJoin>
  <!-- 紙藝展會獲得創造靈感 -->
  <!-- EN: After visiting the paper art exhibition, {PAWN_nameDef} gained a creative inspiration! -->
  <PaperArtExhibitionInspirationReasonText>參觀了紙藝展會後，{PAWN_nameDef}獲得了一個創造靈感！</PaperArtExhibitionInspirationReasonText>
  
  
  
  
