  <!-- 結盟功能提醒 -->
  <!-- EN: Kiiro Workforce Assistance -->
  <Kiiro_LetterLabelWorkAssist>綺羅工作協助</Kiiro_LetterLabelWorkAssist>
  <!-- EN: We a now in allience with the Kiiro. By calling nearby Kiiro town with your comms console you can request workers. -->
  <Kiiro_LetterDescWorkAssist>我們現在與綺羅族結爲了盟友。當殖民地附近存在綺羅族城鎮時，可以通過通訊臺請求臨近的綺羅城鎮派遣幫手協助殖民地的工作。</Kiiro_LetterDescWorkAssist>
  
  <!-- EN: Kiiro Reinforcements -->
  <Kiiro_LetterLabelKiiroAlly>綺羅援軍</Kiiro_LetterLabelKiiroAlly>
  <!-- EN: We a now in allience with the Kiiro. By calling nearby Kiiro town with your comms console you can request reinforcements. -->
  <Kiiro_LetterDescKiiroAlly>我們現在與綺羅族結爲了盟友。當殖民地附近存在綺羅族城鎮時，可以在危險的時刻請求臨近的綺羅城鎮派出援軍。</Kiiro_LetterDescKiiroAlly>

  <!-- EN: Kiiro Merchants -->
  <Kiiro.MerchantInfoLabel>綺羅商戶</Kiiro.MerchantInfoLabel>
  <!-- EN: You now can recruit settling-in merchants at nearby Kirro towns.\n\n Assign a chamber to the merchant by using the Kiiro cash register then their shop is set up. With more operating time and inventory scale the merchant would sell more items and holding more silver. Usually Kiiro merchants would sell goods with lower price as well as peddle their wares to others.\n\n-Merchant-\nAt successful recruitment the merchant with take a short time doing their packages thence joining the colony in the form of temporarily joining in. They will do no work for you, but they shall be willing to fight with you in crisis times.\n\n-Inventory Scale-\nSet shelves or boxes in the shop to increase the inventory scale. Types and quantities of goods in the shop is decided by silver and inventory the merchant hold\n\n -Shop Size-\nMerchants cares about their shop size. With a crowded or narrow shop they will be unpleased, otherwise happy.\n\n-Shop Restock-\nShop will restock peridically and the goods shall be replenished to the maximium based on the shop level.\n\n-Shop Level-\nAs the operating time and scale of the merchant increasing, the shop gets higher levels. High level shops sells more items and holds more silver. Some shop sells special items at reaching a certain level.\n\n-Dismiss Merchants-\nIf you no longer needs a merchant, dissmiss them at the cash register.\n\n-Merchant Safety-\nYou shall secure your merchants safe, once dead your relationship with the Kirro will be greatly impaired.\n\n……\nSee more specificaly in the "Merchant" tab in the bottom. -->
  <Kiiro.MerchantInfoDesc>現在你可以前往附近的綺羅城鎮招募願意入駐到殖民地的商戶了。\n\n使用綺羅收銀臺為商戶指定一處房間，隨後她們的商舖會在殖民地開張。隨著入駐時間和貨物儲量的提升，綺羅的商戶將能夠售賣更多物品，持有的白銀也會增加。綺羅商戶通常會以更低的價格售賣商品，同時她們也會嘗試向其他人兜售。\n\n-商戶-\n在招募成功後會花上一段時間整理並打包自己的行李，之後會以暫時加入的形式入駐殖民地。商戶幾乎不會做任何工作，但你可以徵召她們在危機時刻參與戰鬥，一同保衛殖民地。\n\n-貨物儲量-\n在商舖內安放貨架或是箱子以提升商舖的貨物儲量。一個商舖能夠售賣的貨物種類與數量以及商戶持有的白銀數量與貨物儲量直接掛鉤。\n\n-商舖大小-\n商戶會關心自己商舖的大小。如果一個商舖擁擠或是狹窄，這個商舖的主人會因此悶悶不樂；反之若是商舖寬敞大方，商舖的主人則會變得高興。\n\n-商舖換新-\n商舖會每隔一段時間進貨一次，擁有的貨物也會在進貨時根據目前商舖等級補充至滿。\n\n-商舖等級-\n隨著商戶駐留的時間以及商舖的規模增加，商舖也能逐漸提升等級。等級更高的商舖會能夠售賣更多的貨物和擁有更多的白銀，一些商舖在到達一定級別后還會開始售賣特殊的物品。\n\n-勸離商戶-\n你如果不再想要一個商戶繼續駐留的話，可以在她的收銀臺處對話選項中選擇勸離商戶。\n\n-商戶安全-\n你需要保護所有入駐到殖民地的綺羅商戶。商戶的死亡會嚴重影響與綺羅派系的關係。\n\n……\n更詳細的內容可以在招募到商戶后底部按鈕的「商戶」欄中的指南檢視。</Kiiro.MerchantInfoDesc>
  
  <!-- EN: Kiiro Merchant Reply -->
  <Kiiro.MerchantApply>綺羅商戶回信</Kiiro.MerchantApply>
  <!-- EN: {1}, {0} from {3} accepted our ivitation and send a confirmation letter. At our confirmation {0} will take pakages to travel to {2}, which shall take a time. \n\nAt confirmation we shall start to prepare a shop for {0} in {2}. -->
  <Kiiro.MerchantApplyDesc>來自{3}的{1}，{0}接受了我們的商戶邀請，並寄來了用於確認的信件。在我們確認招募之後，{0}就會收拾行李踏上前來{2}的旅程，這需要一段時間。\n\n確認招募之後，我們需要著手在{2}建造一間為{0}準備的商舖。</Kiiro.MerchantApplyDesc>
  
  <!-- EN: Merchant Rent -->
  <Kiiro.merchantRent>商戶租金結算</Kiiro.merchantRent>
  <!-- EN: At every end of year the merchants would count the annual turnover and pay their rent as below: (a minus turnover counts as 0)\n\n Rent(silver) = Basic Rent x Shop Level Rent Multiplier + 5% Turnover\n\n Merchant operating less than a half year didn't pay this rent. Here's the specific operating performance of the merchants: -->
  <Kiiro.merchantRentSumDesc>到了每年年末商戶們結算租金的日子。殖民地的商戶會總結這一年裡商舖的營業額，並按照如下計算公式向殖民地支付商舖租金（若營業額為負則在參與結算時記為0）：\n\n     租金金額 （白銀） = 基礎租金 x 目前商舖等級租金乘數 + 5%營業額\n\n經營未滿半年的商戶不會參與此次的租金結算。以下是殖民地的商戶在過去一年裡的具體經營情況：</Kiiro.merchantRentSumDesc>
  <!-- EN: Total rent from the merchants this year is {0} silver. All rents(sliver) will be place at the shop cash register or beneth the merchants' foot. As payment complished, shop turnover record will be cleared (That having operated under a year will keep their record till next payment) and then there comes the new year.\n\nGood wishes in the next year! -->
  <Kiiro.merchantRentSumDesc_Post>今年從商戶處收取的租金總額為{0}白銀。所有參與結算的商戶會將白銀放在自己商舖的收銀臺處或自己腳下。租金結算完成後，商舖會清空營業額的記錄（經營未滿一年的商舖會將營業額記錄到下一次結算），然後迎接新年的到來。\n\n來年也請多關照了。</Kiiro.merchantRentSumDesc_Post>
  <!-- EN: {2} from {0}{1} has operated in the colony for {3}. Current shop level of her is {6}. Turnover this year is {4}. Rent payment of {1} this year is: \n {5} x {8} + 5% x {7} = {9} (silver); -->
  <Kiiro.merchantRentSum_ForEach_satisfied>{0}{1}的{2}已經在殖民地經營了{3}，她的商舖的當前等級為{6}，今年的營業額為{4}。{1}今年交付的商舖租金金額為：\n     {5} x {8} + 5% x {7} = {9} （白銀）；</Kiiro.merchantRentSum_ForEach_satisfied>
  <!-- EN: {2} from {0}{1} has operated in the colony for {3}. Current shop level of her is {6}. Turnover this year is {4}.{1} has operated her shop in less than a half year, and pays no rent this time; -->
  <Kiiro.merchantRentSum_ForEach_unsatisfied>{0}{1}的{2}已經在殖民地經營了{3}，她的商舖的當前等級為{6}，今年的營業額為{4}。{1}在殖民地的經營時間未滿半年，此次結算不交付租金；</Kiiro.merchantRentSum_ForEach_unsatisfied>


  <!-- EN: Trade Festival Established -->
  <Kiiro.TradeFestivalSetUp_LetterTitle>貿易節日設立</Kiiro.TradeFestivalSetUp_LetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: After discussing with the Kiiro merchants who have settled in, you have set the Trade Festival to be on the {1} day of {0} every year. During this day and the following period, you will be able to trade with the merchants at discounted prices, and caravans will visit more frequently.\n\nThe Trade Festival will take place as scheduled when the number of Kiiro merchants in the colony reaches 4 or more. -->
